                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-4">
                    <span class="text-tertiary font-bold">[3]</span>
                    <span>The Long Now Foundation. <i>The 10,000 Year Clock and Digital Continuity</i>. Report #82.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section> #}
    </article>
</main>

